      "widgets_values": [
        "Select combined profiles in Load H3 RefMods; files from our earlier character extractor work too. Select your H3 checkpoint, minimax text encoder and decode VAEs. Keep copies=1 and scramble_seed=-1. The official node contains your complete Ref2VA prompt. The sample assumes 3 images per character; use the loader's reference map to adjust Picture/Video/Audio labels to YOUR files. voice_reference_N=1 selects the first recording in slot N; 2 selects the second; 0 explicitly uses all. Do not upload the same cached character refs again to the official node. Binding experiments are not required."
