      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is character A, shown in <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>, <Picture 3>.\n<Audio 1> is the voice-timbre reference for <Subject 1> (S1).\n<Subject 2> is character B, shown in <Picture 4>, <Picture 5>, <Picture 6>.\n<Audio 2> is the voice-timbre reference for <Subject 2> (S2).\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation + audio reference] The characters discuss their journey.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - retain the referenced appearance.\n<Audio 1>: reference - use the voice timbre for the new dialogue.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - retain the referenced appearance.\n<Audio 2>: reference - use the voice timbre for the new dialogue.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] A stationary eye-level medium shot shows the characters in a quiet room lit by soft daylight. Each character's face is clearly visible. They speak one at a time in the order below, with natural expressions and lip movements.\n<Subject 1> (S1) speaks with calm, natural delivery: <d>[English] The old bridge is still standing.</d>, then closes their mouth while listening to the next speaker.\n<Subject 2> (S2) speaks with calm, natural delivery: <d>[English] Then we can cross before sunset.</d>, then closes their mouth while listening to the next speaker.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet room ambience beneath the voices.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
